Just a few of gripes from today's gaming:  I had a high level character
die after a master lich summoned up mondo monsters to attack me.  That isn't
so bad except that I had already genocided all Liches.  How did this one
escape?  (It was the first I've seen since I genocided them).  Also I've 
choked to death in recent games because I wasn't given the opportunity to
stop, and that hasn't been so hot.  I've also had problems getting the wand of
wishing to give the full amount of wishes.  The last one I picked up in the 
castle had one charge left on it (before recharging it).  I don't know if
these have been fixed in PL9, but it would be nice if they were fixed.
Altogether though, the game is quite good and unbelievably better than 2.3
(the first version I played).  I especially like the theology.  Lastly, a
friend of mine asked why you need a blindfold to use telepathy -- couldn't
you just close your eyes?  I couldn't give a good answer -- How 'bout it?

